FFFFF&quot;&gt;02&lt;/text&gt;&lt;text x=&quot;382.5&quot; y=&quot;692&quot; text-anchor=&quot;middle&quot; font-family=&quot;Inter,sans-serif&quot; font-size=&quot;16&quot; font-weight=&quot;900&quot; fill=&quot;#0F172A&quot;&gt;TOOL CALLING&lt;/text&gt;&lt;text x=&quot;382.5&quot; y=&quot;710&quot; text-anchor=&quot;middle&quot; font-family=&quot;Inter,sans-serif&quot; font-size=&quot;16&quot; font-weight=&quot;900&quot; fill=&quot;#0F172A&quot;&gt;&amp; WORKFLOWS&lt;/text&gt;&lt;circle cx=&quot;382.5&quot; cy=&quot;825&quot; r=&quot;21&quot; fill=&quot;#3575E6&quot; stroke=&quot;#FFFFFF&quot; stroke-width=&quot;1.5&quot;/&gt;&lt;circle cx=&quot;382.5&quot; cy=&quot;825&quot; r=&quot;18&quot; fill=&quot;none&quot; stroke=&quot;#FFFFFF&quot; stroke-width=&quot;1.2&quot;/&gt;&lt;text x=&quot;382.5&quot; y=&quot;831&quot; text-anchor=&quot;middle&quot; font-family=&quot;Inter,sans-serif&quot; font-size=&quot;16&quot; font-weight=&quot;900&quot; fill=&quot;#FFFFFF&quot;&gt;01&lt;/text&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;overflow=visible;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="765" height="1024" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

      <mxCell id="hdr65" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center;font-family:Inter,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:52px;font-weight:900;color:#0B132B;letter-spacing:-0.8px;&quot;&gt;AI Capability Pyramid&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:20px;color:#1E293B;margin-top:8px;line-height:1.28;font-weight:400;&quot;&gt;The evolution of Google Cloud agents from raw&lt;br/&gt;inference to fully autonomous systems&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#0F172A;margin-top:16px;&quot;&gt;TIERS&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="42" width="665" height="175" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

      <!-- Left Cards (04 .. 01) -->
      <mxCell id="l65_4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10px 10px;text-align:left;font-family:Inter,sans-serif;width:182px;box-sizing:border-box;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:900;color:#0F172A;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;04 | AUTONOMOUS AGENT&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display:inline-block;background:#8AD9A4;color:#0F172A;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:8px;font-size:9px;font-weight:800;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;GOAL-DRIVEN&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:9.8px;color:#1E293B;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.25;&quot;&gt;Operates on open-ended objectives, self-evaluates success, and automatically resolves errors.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:9.5px;color:#0F172A;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.28;font-weight:500;&quot;&gt;• Self-healing validation loops&lt;br/&gt;• Continuous 24/7 self-directed task resolution&lt;br/&gt;• Long-horizon goal planning&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#FAF8F2;strokeColor=#1E293B;strokeWidth=1.3;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="82" y="214" width="202" height="158" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

      <mxCell id="l65_3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10px 12px;text-align:left;font-family:Inter,sans-serif;width:178px;box-sizing:border-box;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;font-weight:900;color:#0F172A;line-height:1.15;&quot;&gt;03 | MULTI-AGENT&lt;br/&gt;COLLABORATION&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display:inline-block;background:#F9D76B;color:#0F172A;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:8px;font-size:9px;font-weight:800;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;COOPERATIVE&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:9.8px;color:#1E293B;margin-top:5px;line-height:1.24;&quot;&gt;Orchestrating specialized teams passing tasks, debating solutions, and managing shared context.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:9.5px;color:#0F172A;margin-top:5px;line-height:1.28;font-weight:500;&quot;&gt;• Manager-worker dynamic routing&lt;br/&gt;• Shared state persistence &amp; memory&lt;br/&gt;• Agent2Agent (A2A) handoffs&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#FAF8F2;strokeColor=#1E293B;strokeWidth=1.3;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="82" y="388" width="202" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

      <mxCell id="l65_2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10px 12px;text-align:left;font-family:Inter,sans-serif;width:178px;box-sizing:border-box;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;font-weight:900;color:#0F172A;&quot;&gt;02 | TOOL CALLING&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display:inline-block;background:#EB644C;color:#FFFFFF;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:8px;font-size:9px;font-weight:800;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;INTERACTIVE&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:9.8px;color:#1E293B;margin-top:5px;line-height:1.24;&quot;&gt;Models interact natively with environments, executing code, using APIs, and navigating databases.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:9.5px;color:#0F172A;margin-top:5px;line-height:1.28;font-weight:500;&quot;&gt;• API integrations &amp; Skill Plugins&lt;br/&gt;• Computer-use &amp; sandboxed runtimes (GKE)&lt;br/&gt;• Model Context Protocol (MCP)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#FAF8F2;strokeColor=#1E293B;strokeWidth=1.3;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="82" y="568" width="202" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

      <mxCell id="l65_1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;padding:10px 12px;text-align:left;font-family:Inter,sans-serif;width:178px;box-sizing:border-box;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;font-weight:900;color:#0F172A;&quot;&gt;01 | BASE GEMINI&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display:inline-block;background:#4E8DF5;color:#FFFFFF;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:8px;font-size:9px;font-weight:800;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;RAW INFERENCE&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:9.8px;color:#1E293B;margin-top:5px;line-height:1.24;&quot;&gt;Standard foundation model reasoning based entirely on input prompts, text generation, and in-context data.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:9.5px;color:#0F172A;margin-top:5px;line-height:1.28;font-weight:500;&quot;&gt;• Chain-of-thought (CoT) planning&lt;br/&gt;• Natural language understanding&lt;br/&gt;• Few-shot prompting&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#FAF8F2;strokeColor=#1E293B;strokeWidth=1.3;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="82" y="750" width="202" height="154" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

